page=f'''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Key Risks — assignment audit</title><style>body{{font:16px/1.45 system-ui;background:#f5f3ec;color:#283c30;max-width:1150px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 18px}}h1{{margin-bottom:8px}}a{{color:#256342}}.summary{{font-size:20px;font-weight:650}}nav{{position:sticky;top:0;background:#f5f3ec;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #bac5b7;z-index:1;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}}input,select{{font:inherit;padding:8px;max-width:100%}}section{{background:#fffef9;border:1px solid #ccd3c5;border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin:22px 0}}article{{display:grid;grid-template-columns:104px 1fr;gap:15px;border-top:1px solid #ddd;padding:18px 0}}.art img{{width:96px;height:96px;object-fit:contain}}.source{{color:#647060;font-size:14px}}p{{margin:7px 0}}.badge{{border-radius:4px;padding:2px 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:650}}.keep{{background:#d9ecd8}}.refine{{background:#fff0bb}}.replace,.missing{{background:#f7d9ce}}.proposal{{font-weight:550}}.duplicate{{color:#87520b}}.empty{{color:#9d4036}}.fine{{font-size:14px;color:#5d685c}}[hidden]{{display:none!important}}@media(max-width:550px){{article{{grid-template-columns:60px 1fr}}.art img{{width:56px;height:56px}}}}</style><h1>Key Risks: assignment audit</h1><p class="summary">{summary}</p><p>24 September 2026. Every currently displayed risk checked against its crop-specific prose and the actual approved drawing. <strong>{len(affected)} crops have an icon concern; {len(serious)} have a replacement or missing-icon issue.</strong> Six crops also show duplicate identities. These are review findings: no assignments, artwork or gardening records have been changed.</p><p>“Keep” allows a useful general symbol for the right subject. “Refine” is related but weak. “Replace” points to the wrong subject, organ or process, or loses the meaning. Icon judgments are editorial; source links support the biological distinctions.</p><p><strong>First fixes:</strong> chocolate spot → leaf spot; halo blight → trial leaf spot; Jerusalem-artichoke stem rot → trial stem rot; chicory soil caterpillars → caterpillar; mushroom flies → fly; beet-leaf-miner alias → fly after deduplication. All are proposals and need crop-aware mappings.</p><p><strong>New-art priorities:</strong> allium basal rot, leafy-heart rot, storage-root texture/lesions, tomato splitting, cucurbit fruit/stalk problems, sweet-corn pollination, potato scab/nematodes, mushroom problems and the three rhubarb meanings. Bitterness and cross-pollination lack a dependable visible defect: use a crop/process cue with the label, not invented symptoms.</p><p><strong>Selection issues:</strong> Club Root/Clubroot repeats on broccoli, Brussels sprouts, cabbage and cauliflower; beet leaf miner repeats under its Mangold Fly alias; parsnip repeats poor germination. Fix these before deciding the final artwork list, because another risk will become visible.</p><p class="fine">Parsnip’s Carrot Fly text also refers to “carrots”. The HTML scan emitted layout-budget warnings for broad bean, French bean and courgettes/marrows, plus the documented mushroom sowing fallback; no PDFs were generated or layout changes made. <a href="KEY-RISK-ASSIGNMENTS-AUDIT.json">Full audit and evidence</a> · <a href="KEY-RISK-ASSIGNMENTS-INVENTORY.json">Rendered inventory</a> · <a href="NATURALISTIC-INSTALLED.html">Current page examples</a>.</p><nav><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Find a vegetable" aria-label="Find a vegetable"><select id="mode" aria-label="Filter"><option value="issues">Crops with concerns</option><option value="all">All 44 crops</option><option value="replace">Replacement / missing only</option><option value="refine">Refinements only</option><option value="keep">Keep only</option></select><span id="count"></span></nav><main>{''.join(cards)}</main><script>const input=document.querySelector('#search'),mode=document.querySelector('#mode');function filter(){{let count=0;for(const s of document.querySelectorAll('section')){{let visible=0;for(const a of s.querySelectorAll('article')){{a.hidden=!['issues','all'].includes(mode.value)&&(mode.value==='replace'?!['replace','missing'].includes(a.dataset.status):a.dataset.status!==mode.value);if(!a.hidden)visible++}}s.hidden=!s.dataset.crop.includes(input.value.toLowerCase())||!visible||(mode.value==='issues'&&s.dataset.issues!=='true');if(!s.hidden)count++}}document.querySelector('#count').textContent=count+' crops shown'}}input.addEventListener('input',filter);mode.addEventListener('change',filter);filter();</script></html>'''
